<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea denies report of stricken N.Korean ship.</title>
<headline>S.Korea denies report of stricken N.Korean ship.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean marine police on Tuesday denied a television report that a stricken North Korean vessel waving a white distress flag had been spotted in crashing seas off the east coast.</p>
<p>A police spokesman said a South Korean resident who originally raised the alarm was mistaken, and the object at sea was in fact a buoy.</p>
</text>
